        "original_id": "c9bb02e6-a910-5de7-bfce-43ffe6be211b",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Manfred von Richthofen, Red Baron\n- Organizations: German Air Force\n- Events: World War I\n- Topics: popular culture, aviation history, air combat victories\n\nFacts:\n- Manfred von Richthofen, also known as the Red Baron, served as a fighter pilot with the German Air Force during World War I.\n- Manfred von Richthofen is considered the ace-of-aces of World War I and was officially credited with 80 air combat victories.\n- Manfred von Richthofen is one of the most famous aviators in history.\n- Manfred von Richthofen has been the subject of many books, films, and other media in popular culture.",
